#
#	OpenTPW swimming pools: the water slide tower (tube profile)
#	Every number marked "OpenTPW's own value" is a choice of this extension, not a value of the original game.
#
Info.Id			65100		placeholder: objects.json replaces it with the object's own id
Info.Name		"Water Slide Tower"
Info.IsChoosable	0		guests never choose it: slides are reachable only from the pool
Info.HasQueue		0
Info.WhichUIType	3		the build menu's Features tab

# A 2 x 2 tower with no entrance: its stairs face the pool (the shape's top row, the local -V side), and Pools.SlideTower makes the engine look for water there.
Info.Shape
---
**
**
---

# The construction fence for 2 x 2 cells: the four corner pieces
Info.Hoarding
---
F7
LJ
---

# OpenTPW's own keys: the engine reads them to know this object carries a water slide
Pools.SlideTower	1
Pools.SlideProfile	1		0 an open flume, 1 a closed tube
Pools.SlideCapacity	4		riders waiting on the platform (OpenTPW's own value)

UsageInfo.ExcitementLevel		0
UsageInfo.MinCapacity			1
UsageInfo.MaxCapacity			4		OpenTPW's own value

Upgrades[0].CostOfUpgrade		600		OpenTPW's own value
Upgrades[0].CostOfResearch		0		An object without research cost starts researched
Upgrades[0].InitCapacity		4		OpenTPW's own value
Research.Group		0
Info.PreviewAnimNum		0
